{
  "name": "Rendley — Dubbing Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Dubbing Pipeline\n\nPOST a video URL and a target language. The flow creates a project and **dubs** the video into the target language (`video-translate`) — the result is a full video whose audio track is the translated speech, with the original speaker's voice characteristics preserved. The node resolves it to a fresh presigned URL, which we download and copy to your storage.\n\n**Send:** `POST /webhook/dubbing` with `{ \"video_url\": \"https://…/en.mp4\", \"target_language\": \"es\" }`.\n\n> `target_language` must be a valid Rendley language id — see `GET /v1/ai/video-translate/languages` (the node's Output Language dropdown lists them).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Credits\nDubbing is an AI action that consumes **credits** and needs a paid Rendley plan. Order of magnitude: **~80–200 credits** per short clip, scaling with duration. Use the action's `/cost` endpoint (the node's *Estimate Cost Only* toggle) for an exact quote before running.",
        "height": 210,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Plan and cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why no lip-sync step?\nRendley's `video-translate` outputs a complete **video** (translated audio already baked in) — it has no audio-only mode. `lipsync` needs a separate **audio** track, so chaining the dub result into it does not work (the API rejects a video where audio is expected). Lip movement in the dubbed video is therefore not re-synced. If you have a standalone translated audio track (e.g. from Text to Speech), lip-sync the *original* video to that instead.\n\nThe Dub node waits inline with **Wait for Completion** (10 s+ interval) to keep the flow linear; raise **Timeout (Minutes)** for long sources.",
        "height": 210,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Why inline",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Links expire — copy the file!\nThe lip-sync result is a **presigned media URL that expires after ~3 hours** (exports expire after ~4h). This flow downloads it and re-uploads to your own Google Drive so you keep a permanent copy.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Expiry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "dubbing",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Incoming Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        460
      ],
      "webhookId": "dubbing-in"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "project",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "={{ 'Dub ' + $json.body.target_language + ' ' + $now.format('yyyy-LL-dd HH:mm') }}"
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Create Project",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "video",
        "operation": "dub",
        "projectId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "mediaFile": "={{ $('Incoming Request').item.json.body.video_url }}",
        "outputLanguage": "={{ $('Incoming Request').item.json.body.target_language }}",
        "aiOptions": {
          "mode": "precision"
        },
        "estimateCostOnly": false,
        "waitForCompletion": true,
        "pollInterval": 10
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Rendley — Dub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.download_url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Download Dubbed Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "name": "={{ 'dubbed-' + $('Incoming Request').item.json.body.target_language + '-' + $now.format('yyyyLLdd-HHmmss') + '.mp4' }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dd000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Save to Google Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1060,
        460
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Incoming Request": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Project",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Project": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Rendley — Dub",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Rendley — Dub": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download Dubbed Video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download Dubbed Video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save to Google Drive",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
